OL,3,GNEWSAUnseen Vivienne Westwood photos
OL,4,Ashow 'born protester'
OL,5,
OL,6,FFrom Alan Bennett to Sir Alex Ferguson,
OL,7,FBetty Boothroyd to Bez and Fred Dibnah
OL,8,Fto Iain Duncan Smith, Paul Wolfgang
OL,9,FWebster has photographed a wide range
OL,10,Fof well-known faces across his
OL,11,Fdecades-long career, but one eluded
OL,12,Fhim.
OL,14,FAs a punk, he always wanted to capture
OL,15,Fan icon of the scene, Dame Vivienne
OL,16,FWestwood, but never had the
OL,17,Fopportunity.
OL,19,FThat was until the fashion legend
OL,20,Fturned up at an anti-fracking protest
OL,21,Fin Lancashire in 2018.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
