OL,3,GNEWSAUnseen Vivienne Westwood photos
OL,4,Ashow 'born protester'
OL,5,
OL,6,FDiscussing the event ahead of an
OL,7,Fexhibition of his unseen photographs
OL,8,Ffrom that day, Wolfgang said the
OL,9,Fencounter was everything he had always
OL,10,Fhoped it would be, adding: "It was like
OL,11,Fshe was Joan of Arc, walking down the
OL,12,Fstreet with this big crusade of people
OL,13,Fbehind her."
